OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 35, jailed for rape after    
OL,4,Aprevious deportation warning           
OL,6,FHe had previously been jailed for      
OL,7,Fattempted rape, and was told at the    
OL,8,Ftime to expect deportation as soon as  
OL,9,Fhe was released, but he subsequently   
OL,10,Fremained in the UK.                    
